# The Dawning Archaic (cast on turn 3 for {6}, four instants and sorceries in Bot1's graveyard). On turn 5 it attacks and its
# trigger offers "target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard": refused are the Black Lotus (an artifact) and Bot2's Shock
# (the other player's graveyard); Bot1's own Lightning Bolt is chosen, cast for no mana (all four Mox Rubies stay untapped) at Bot2
# and, resolving, exiled rather than put into the graveyard. The 7/7 is unblocked: Bot2 takes 3 on turn 1, 3 and 7 on turn 5.

